{"fetch_error_details() zips error_ids with events.values() from nodestore.backend.get_multi, but the dict iteration order is not guaranteed to match error_ids order, and if any lookup returns None the zip stops early. This can associate wrong stack traces with error ids or drop trailing errors. Should look up each error id by its node id instead.": 0.9575333595275879, "When `use-table-widget-visualization` is enabled, TableWidgetVisualization is instantiated with empty columns and empty tableData placeholders, causing blank widgets even though the API returned rows. The actual result payload should be passed through the new component.": 0.9979702830314636}